description:
Stop paying full Zoho Books user license costs for staff who only need to approve vendor bills. Learn how to configure a custom field, workflow rule, and Deluge script to handle one-click bill approvals via email and webhooks.

1. Create a custom field named 'Approval Status' in Zoho Books Bill preferences.
2. Set up a Workflow Rule on Bill creation that triggers a Deluge script sending an email with action links.
3. Use a Zoho Flow webhook link to receive the approval response and update the bill status via Zoho Books API.

Code (deluge) - Settings › Automation › Workflow Rules › Actions › Custom Functions:
billId = bill.get("bill_id");
billNumber = bill.get("bill_number");
totalAmount = bill.get("total");
approverEmail = "manager@example.com";
webhookBaseUrl = "https://flow.zoho.com/YOUR_ORG_ID/flow/api/webhook";
approveUrl = webhookBaseUrl + "?bill_id=" + billId + "&action=Approved";
rejectUrl = webhookBaseUrl + "?bill_id=" + billId + "&action=Rejected";
emailContent = "‹p›New Bill Pending Approval: ‹b›" + billNumber + "‹/b›‹/p›";
emailContent = emailContent + "‹p›Total: " + totalAmount + "‹/p›";
emailContent = emailContent + "‹p›‹a href='" + approveUrl + "'›Click to Approve‹/a› | ‹a href='" + rejectUrl + "'›Click to Reject‹/a›‹/p›";
sendmail
[
	from :zoho.adminuserid
	to :approverEmail
	subject :"Approval Required: Bill #" + billNumber
	message :emailContent
];

